Welcome to Face Swap, an application that transforms photos into works of art! The app provides a range of features allowing you to create flawless pictures.

Video Face Replacement;

Choose from a selection of videos within the app, upload your photo, and watch as your face seamlessly integrates into the video, offering a unique and custom experience.

Automatic photo enhancement; 

Advanced AI technology meticulously analyzes each pixel of your photo and offers enhancement options for you to choose from ensuring the most suitable adjustments.

Photo restoration; 

Has your old photo been damaged by scratches or creases? No worries! Our app automatically eliminates these imperfections, making necessary corrections to give your photo a rejuvenated look.

Sketch effect; 

Transform your photo into a captivating cartoon like drawing with a tap using our app. Watch as vibrant and colorful tones bring your image to life!

Photo correction;

Automatic photo correction feature enhances the colors, contrast and brightness of your photo to give it a touch.

Try out our AI powered photo editor now and transform your photos into stunning masterpieces!

